            "en": {
              "text": "<p>I am <b>Abhishek Malay</b>, a Computer Science & Engineering student and <b>Full Stack Web Developer</b> focused on building scalable MERN and PHP/Laravel applications.</p><p>I work with <b>MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js, PHP Laravel, MySQL, REST APIs, JWT authentication</b>, and responsive interfaces. I enjoy turning product ideas into reliable web applications with clean APIs, secure authentication, and maintainable user experiences.</p><p>My experience includes co-founding KaleidoNex Technologies and contributing to healthcare, job portal, real-time chat, and wedding planning platforms.</p>"
